      "text": "is_at_risk = no_digital_access_14d OR kit_failed_sla OR\nno_tasks_completed. recoverable_mrr_usd carries the account's\nmonthly price when it is at risk, and is null otherwise.",
      "originalText": "is_at_risk = no_digital_access_14d OR kit_failed_sla OR\nno_tasks_completed. recoverable_mrr_usd carries the account's\nmonthly price when it is at risk, and is null otherwise.",
