      "text": "risk_driver says WHICH leg failed; damage_class says WHETHER\nIT IS WORTH ACTING ON. Prioritise system-inflicted -- those\naccounts failed because of a delivery failure the company\nowns, which makes the outreach credible rather than annoying.",
