      "locked": false,
      "text": "The tenure threshold is calibrated, not assumed. An absolute\n180-day cut yields FOUR accounts base-wide and collapses the\nclass to zero, leaving an unworkable two-bucket list. That\nonly 11 accounts land in self_selected is itself the finding:\ntenure does not discriminate in this data.",
